                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.00/2302: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Minister in the
                        Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Russell</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-01-25T19:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 25,
                                1921—7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>5. Your 4, January 23, 5 p.m.</p>
                <p>The Department is willing to accept the recommendation offered by the Military
                    Governor and by yourself that the membership of the Commission be limited to
                    seven, …</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Davis</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
